      "text": "Kitab al-Riyad: A Judgment Between the Two Reformers Why al-Kirmani Wrote This Book Al-Kirmani opens the book itself in his own voice, with the Basmala — SAYING"
    },
    {
      "page": 109,
      "words": 201,
      "text": "As for the seventh section, and the saying of the author of al-Nusrah that every doer does what he does only in seeking to attain what he wills, and especially "
